content.text:
Potential issue: `useEffect` dependency `project?.revision` triggers on every revision; when user is in tools section and applies filters, the POST returns project + recommendations and sets state. Then revision changes -> effect re-fetches recommendations, okay. The `initialized` state stays true, so local checkboxes don't reset. Fine. But when fresh project loads, component may mount with result null and then initialize. Good.

Potential issue: `ToolRecommendations` conditionally returns before computing `apply`/`decide`, but hooks are before returns, fine. However `useState` initializers use `result` which can be null; okay.

`select` and `input` styles need CSS. Add.

Also `RecommendationAction extends ActionResult` before ActionResult declaration is fine in TS.

Now CSS. Add classes to styles.css. Ensure narrow layout. `.tool-grid` grid auto-fit minmax(260px, 1fr). `.filters` grid. Form elements inherit font and colors. Existing `textarea, button.action` rule; add `input, select`. Need style checkboxes.

Add:
```
.tools { margin-top: var(--space-5); border-top: 1px solid...; padding-top...}
.filters { display:grid; gap; grid-template-columns...; margin...}
fieldset {border... border-radius; padding...}
legend {color: var(--accent)}
.chips {display:flex; flex-wrap; gap}
.chip { ... }
.chip.active { background: rgb(...); color...}
label.check { display:flex; align-items:center; gap; margin-top:...}
input, select { font: inherit; color: var(--text); background: var(--bg); border...; border-radius: 8px; padding...; min-height: 36px}
input[type=checkbox] { width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--accent);}
.tool-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap}
.tool-card { background: var(--raised); border...; border-radius:14px; padding; display:grid; gap; align-content:start; min-width:0}
.tool-card.decided { border-color: var(--spirit)}
.tool-head {display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap; align-items:flex-start}
.tool-head h3 {margin:0; font-family...}
.badge { ...}
.badge.warn {color: var(--danger); border-color...}
.why-list {list-style:none; padding:0; display:grid; gap}
.why-list li {display:flex; gap; align-items:flex-start}
.why-list svg {color: var(--success); flex:none; margin-top: 4px}
.tool-actions {display:flex; flex-wrap; gap}
.source-list {display:grid; gap; padding-left: 1.1rem; overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.baseline {margin-top...}
.selected-tools ...
```
Also `button.action` disabled already opacity. Add `.tool-card details summary` cursor pointer; `summary` color accent.

`input` width 100%? For number, maybe. Use `input:not([type=checkbox]), select { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }`.

Need `fieldset label` margins. Existing `label { display:grid; gap; margin-top }`. For `.check`, override `display:flex; margin-top: var(--space-2)`.

Add `h3` styles.

Let's append before media queries maybe at end. Use edit append before `@media (min-width: 960px)`.

